Vgcb0 gc_11 0 DC 0.75
* ---- gk: 3 x 3 nodes, 20 mOhm per edge, 1 A per node, bumps at [(0, 0)]
Rgkh00 gk_00 gk_01 0.02
Rgkv00 gk_00 gk_10 0.02
Rgkh01 gk_01 gk_02 0.02
Rgkv01 gk_01 gk_11 0.02
